{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-04-01 09:00:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ CLOSES DEAL WITH BRAZILIAN FOOD COMPANY HEMMER', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ”), THE OWNER OF THE HEINZ AND QUERO BRANDS IN BRAZIL, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF A MAJORITY STAKE IN COMPANHIA HEMMER INDÚSTRIA E COMÉRCIO (“HEMMER”), A BRAZILIAN FOOD COMPANY FOCUSED ON CONDIMENTS AND SAUCES, AFTER THE DEAL WAS APPROVED WITHOUT RESTRICTION BY CADE (BRAZIL'S ADMINISTRATIVE COUNCIL FOR ECONOMIC DEFENSE), BRAZIL'S ANTITRUST BODY. THE PROPOSED DEAL WAS ANNOUNCED IN"}